      "value": "Here is the Blueprint ID for testing avatar.\n\navtr_d4b2c660-97ef-43c8-a45a-54ae4b4b20f4\n\nThe cube on the right, whose material properties have been modified by the animation, appears to fallback correctly to Unlit.\n\nThe cube on the center, whose material itself have been overwritten by the animation, does not appear to fallback. (overwritten to the same material)\n\nThe cube on the left was uploaded in an inactive and was changed to active from the Expression Menu after starting fallback previewing. It also appears to fallback correctly to Unlit.",
